#: ../../source/user_guide/speculative_decoding.rst:71
msgid ""
"Translated into ``--speculative-algorithm NEXTN`` with the matching "
"``speculative_num_steps`` / ``speculative_num_draft_tokens``. An explicitly "
"provided ``speculative_algorithm`` is left untouched."
msgstr ""
"转换为 ``--speculative-algorithm NEXTN``，并设置匹配的 ``speculative_num_steps`` / "
"``speculative_num_draft_tokens``。如果已显式提供 ``speculative_algorithm``，则保留原配置。"

